<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/sdg_10_20"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-04-29</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Adjusted gross disposable income of households per capita</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt; Disparities in national household income per capita across the EU and Euro area are calculated as the coefficient of variation of adjusted gross disposable income of households and Non-Profit Institutions Serving Households (NPISH) divided by the purchasing power parities (PPP) of the actual individual consumption of households and by the total resident population. The indicator reflects national differences in the purchasing power of households and their ability to invest in goods and services or save for the future, by accounting for taxes and social contributions and monetary in-kind social benefits. The time series offer a measure of the convergence of household income within the EU and Euro area.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Revenu disponible brut ajusté des ménages par personne</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt; Les disparités entre les revenus nationaux des ménages par habitant dans l’UE et dans la zone euro sont calculées comme étant le coefficient de variation du revenu disponible brut ajusté des ménages et des institutions sans but lucratif au service des ménages (ISBLSM) divisé par les parités de pouvoir d’achat (PPA) de la consommation individuelle réelle des ménages et par la population résidente totale. L’indicateur reflète les différences nationales en ce qui concerne le pouvoir d’achat des ménages et leur capacité à investir dans des biens et services ou à épargner à l’avenir, en tenant compte des impôts, des cotisations sociales et des prestations sociales monétaires en nature. Les séries chronologiques permettent de mesurer la convergence des revenus des ménages au sein de l’UE et de la zone euro.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Verfügbares Pro-Kopf-Einkommen der Haushalte</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt; Die Unterschiede beim nationalen Pro-Kopf-Einkommen der privaten Haushalte in der EU und im Euro-Währungsgebiet werden berechnet als Variationskoeffizient des bereinigten verfügbaren Bruttoeinkommens der privaten Haushalte und der privaten Organisationen ohne Erwerbszweck dividiert durch die Kaufkraftparitäten (KKP) des tatsächlichen Individualverbrauchs der privaten Haushalte und die gesamte Wohnbevölkerung. Der Indikator spiegelt nationale Unterschiede bei der Kaufkraft der privaten Haushalte und ihrer Fähigkeit wider, in Waren und Dienstleistungen zu investieren oder in Zukunft zu sparen, indem Steuern und Sozialbeiträge sowie monetäre Sozialleistungen verbucht werden. Die Zeitreihen liefern ein Maß für die Konvergenz des Haushaltseinkommens in der EU und im Euro-Währungsgebiet.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>sdg_10_20</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_10_20"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=CVA"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Variationskoeffizient für den absoluten Wert</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Coefficient of variation for absolute value</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Coefficient de variation de la valeur absolue</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-05-05</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2000-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_10_20"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_10_20</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.htm"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) HTML</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_10_20"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/cache/metadata/en/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.htm]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><foaf:page><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.sdmx.zip"><dct:title xml:lang="en">ESMS metadata (Euro-SDMX Metadata structure) SDMX</dct:title><foaf:topic rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/sdg_10_20"/><schema:url xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/files?file=metadata/sdg_10_20_esmsip2.sdmx.zip]]></schema:url><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/xml"/><dct:type><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/DOCUMENTATION_MAIN"/></dct:type></foaf:Document></foaf:page><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/sdg_10_20/default/table"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Table, graphs and map visualizations are also available.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Des visualisations sous forme de tableau, graphique et carte géographique sont aussi disponibles.</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Tabellen, Grafiken und geografische Darstellungen sind ebenfalls verfügbar.</dct:title><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/sdg_10_20/default/table"/><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/VISUALIZATION"/><dct:license rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/><dct:rights rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html"/></dcat:Distribution></dcat:distribution><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/sdg_10_20?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"><dct:title xml:lang="en">Download dataset in TSV format</dct:title><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-type/DOWNLOADABLE_FILE"/><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/sdg_10_20?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dcat:downloadURL rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/data/sdg_10_20?format=tsv&amp;compressed=true"/><dct:compressformat><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GZIP"/></dct:compressformat><dct:format><dct:MediaTypeOrExtent rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/TSV"/></dct:format><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/tab-separated-values"/><dct:license><dct:LicenseDocument rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licenc